from plugins/security/skills/ad-cs/. MIT licence governs SKILL.md and all references.

Files folded -> reference mapping:
  plugins/security/skills/ad-cs/SKILL.md
    -> SKILL.md (skill body: When to use, When not to use, core model covering CA hierarchy/
       certificate templates/enrolment methods/certificate revocation/key event IDs/
       hardening checklist; reference router; cross-references; red flags; bottom line)
    -> references/architecture.md (CA hierarchy, template flags and EKU reference, enrolment
       method detail, revocation mechanics, CA configuration flags, certificate mapping/
       KB5014754, common troubleshooting)
    -> references/vulnerabilities.md (ESC1-ESC16 attack path documentation)
  plugins/security/skills/ad-cs/references/vulnerabilities.md
    -> references/vulnerabilities.md (ESC1-ESC16: full conditions, exploitation examples,
